/* Legacy staff styling, carried from https://cdn.uhub.org.au/EMS/css/UT_Staff.css
   (copied 30 October 2026) so pages that still rely on it keep working
   without that stylesheet. Temporary: clean these rules up, or replace them
   with theme components, as each page is migrated, and delete the block
   once it is empty.

   Rules only, reformatted to the house style; selectors and values are
   unchanged except for these:
   - Left out, because the theme already covers them: the staff nav icons
     (US-STAFF-NAV-ICONS) and the a.logo image (the client Override.css).
   - Left out of :root, because the theme defines its own and nothing here
     reads them: --sidebar-w and --text-muted.
   - The coming-soon image URLs were root-relative to the CDN; they now name
     cdn.uhub.org.au so they resolve the same from the theme.
   - Added: a reset that keeps the legacy record banner (a Query Template)
     out of the theme's Query Template card styling. It is marked where it
     sits, under the contact record banner rules.
   - Added: the theme's Query Template card for an empty Query Template in a
     section-scrollable panel (the original contact layout's Workplace
     Delegates and Organisers with no results), at the end of the block.

   It loads after the native button colours and before every other theme
   component, so the theme wins wherever the specificity is equal. The
   colours are hard-coded and do not follow dark mode. */

/* ── colors.css ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
