/* Loading (US-NATIVE-LOADERS adds the spinner). The iPart's placeholder,
   div#formrender_<key>, shows a 20px spinner.gif until the form renders
   into it; .us-native-loader-host already drops the gif. The placeholder
   becomes the form's [data-beyondformid] element, so the same host also
   covers a form its own script hides with data-us-loading until its data
   is in. The spinner sits near the top rather than halfway down a tall
   hidden form. */
:is([id^="formrender_"]:not(.rendered-form *), [data-beyondformid]).us-native-loader-host:not(:where(.us-report-no-styling, .us-report-no-styling *)) {
  position: relative;
  height: auto !important;
  min-height: 120px;
