/* us-cco-rail: v1's edge-attached sidebar, page structure rather than a
   content card. One class brings us-cco-cards and us-cco-collapsible.
   Square, white, one border on the content side; in the page-level column it
   bleeds through the column's half-gutter to the page edge (as the banner
   does) and, when a banner is directly above, rises to meet it (the gap is
   measured by US-CCO-SIDEBAR). Rules written
   .us-cco-rail:is(.us-cco-collapsible, .us-cco-rail) keep the weight they
   need over the collapsible and right-hand rules. */
@media (min-width: 601px) {
  :root .us-cco-rail :is(.cco, .tabs-wrapper).tabs-vertical:not([data-us-cco-rail="collapsed"]):not(:where(.us-cco-rail :is(.cco, .tabs-wrapper) :is(.cco, .tabs-wrapper), .us-report-no-styling, .us-report-no-styling *)) > .RadTabStripVertical {
