/* A small phone caps the brand box so the account menu (its name
   capped at 9em by Orion) stays on its row; rows wrap before items shrink,
   so a cap is needed rather than shrinking. The logo is drawn to fit its
   box, so it only gets smaller on the narrowest screens. */
@media (max-width: 480px) {
